Model weights:
  models/signature_stamp_detector.pt -- single-class ("signature") YOLO11n detector,
      fine-tuned with Ultralytics from the pretrained yolo11n weights. Because the
      Ultralytics toolchain and base weights are AGPL-3.0, treat these weights as
      AGPL-3.0 as well. See models/MODEL_CARD.md.

